  "runtime_notes": [
    "Active trader is determined by local manifest and observed processes, not solely by the example entrypoint.",
    "Smart Money v2.3 heartbeat is more authoritative than Windows command-line discovery.",
    "Task installation mode is derived from current installer script; confirm on host before relying on it.",
    "Historical observed Smart Money PID 3096 is not a persistent identifier.",
    "Balanced EV, Runner Hunter and DIY Whale are research-model variants within paper_research_lab_v11_10.py, not three separately supervised trading processes.",
    "Non-disruptive CryptoTracker host attestation is read-only and confirms source sync, process identity/start time for supervisor/agent/trader/dashboard, Smart Money v2.3 fresh healthy feed heartbeat, and a post-sync crypto EOD send record; these do NOT attest in-memory source digest, a wallet swap, or device Pushover delivery. Results are stored under ignored deploy/state and sanitized status is published to an isolated private branch cryptotracker-host-status (disable with CRYPTOTRACKER_ATTESTATION_REMOTE_ENABLED=0); no crypto trade settings, local checkout or supervisor processes changed. Running deployment agent must be reloaded through separately approved host action to adopt new monitoring hook."
  ],
